my-express-app/
├── node_modules/
├── src/                   # All source code goes here
│   ├── config/            
│   │   └── db.js          # Database connection logic
│   ├── models/            
│   │   ├── User.js        # Schemas & Models (e.g., User, Product)
│   │   └── Post.js
│   ├── controllers/       # Business logic (handling requests)
│   ├── routes/            # Route definitions
│   ├── middleware/        # Auth, error handling, etc.
├── .env                   # Environment variables (DB URI, Secrets)
├── .gitignore
├── package.json
└── index.js              # Entry point to start the server

Student application process
step 1. Application Form > ARN Generation ( Future actions will be based on the ARN ).
step 2. Aadhar Paperless Kyc.
step 3. Physical verification.
step 4. Payment.
step 5. Final Account Generation.

Student schema requirements.

name
fatherName
motherName
dob
gender
standard
role
address >
    houseNo
    street
    district
    state
    postcode
    country
phoneNumber
email
appointment >
    state
    appointmentId
status >
    state
    note
payment >
    state
    mode
    date
kyc >
    docType
    docNumber
    state
    note